exports.description:
How much of a window must stay inside the work area (W45). `full`: all of it;
`title`: the title bar stays reachable (the OS behaviour, so a window can hang
off the side); `none`: no limit (a canvas that scrolls).

`count` rects tiling `area` (W71). `columns`: side by side; `rows`: stacked;
`grid`: ⌈√n⌉ columns, filled row by row, with the last row's windows widened
to fill it, so the area is always covered with no hole.

Installs `windowsKeyboardPlugin(manager)` on the nearest `KeyboardProvider`
while mounted (W93). Options are read when the manager or keyboard changes,
not on every render, so an inline object is fine.
